  "title": {
    "raw": "Fashion Photoshoot for Discollection",
    "rendered": "Fashion Photoshoot for Discollection"
  },
  "content": {
    "raw": "<a href=\"http://www.flickr.com/photos/kk/357281035/\" title=\"Photo Sharing\"><img src=\"http://farm1.static.flickr.com/151/357281035_f16b3043cd_m.jpg\" alt=\"In &amp; Out\" height=\"240\" width=\"161\" align=\"left\" style=\"margin-right: 5px\"/></a> <p><a href=\"http://flickr.com/photos/discollection\" title=\"Kdon&#39;s Flickr\">Kdon</a> over at <a href=\"http://discollection.ca\" title=\"Designer Vintage Clothes\">Discollection</a> is an amazing designer and stylist. I&#39;ve been using her for lots of <a href=\"http://staticphotography.com\" title=\"Vancouver Fashion and Portrait Photography\">Static Photography</a> shoots lately and was even more impressed than usual in the job she did styling the <a href=\"http://www.modelmayhem.com/member.php?id=269667\" title=\"Ashley-Rae on ModelMayhem\">Ashley-Rae</a> photoshoot with awesome <a href=\"http://discollection.ca\" title=\"Vancouer Designer Vintage Clothes\">designer vintage clothes</a> from her store. </p> \n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"kk-collection-footer\"} -->\n<p class=\"kk-collection-footer\">Part of the <a href=\"https://kriskrug.co/ai-for-creatives/\">AI for Creatives</a> collection. See also: <a href=\"https://kriskrug.co/2026/06/04/ai-keynote-slides-visual-workflow/\">AI Keynote Slides Need Taste Before Prompts</a>.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->",
    "rendered": "<a href=\"http://www.flickr.com/photos/kk/357281035/\" title=\"Photo Sharing\"><img data-recalc-dims=\"1\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i0.wp.com/farm1.static.flickr.com/151/357281035_f16b3043cd_m.jpg?resize=161%2C240\" alt=\"In &amp; Out\" height=\"240\" width=\"161\" align=\"left\" style=\"margin-right: 5px\"/></a> <p><a href=\"http://flickr.com/photos/discollection\" title=\"Kdon&#39;s Flickr\">Kdon</a> over at <a href=\"http://discollection.ca\" title=\"Designer Vintage Clothes\">Discollection</a> is an amazing designer and stylist. I&#39;ve been using her for lots of <a href=\"http://staticphotography.com\" title=\"Vancouver Fashion and Portrait Photography\">Static Photography</a> shoots lately and was even more impressed than usual in the job she did styling the <a href=\"http://www.modelmayhem.com/member.php?id=269667\" title=\"Ashley-Rae on ModelMayhem\">Ashley-Rae</a> photoshoot with awesome <a href=\"http://discollection.ca\" title=\"Vancouer Designer Vintage Clothes\">designer vintage clothes</a> from her store. </p> \n\n\n<p class=\"kk-collection-footer wp-block-paragraph\">Part of the <a href=\"https://kriskrug.co/ai-for-creatives/\">AI for Creatives</a> collection. See also: <a href=\"https://kriskrug.co/2026/06/04/ai-keynote-slides-visual-workflow/\">AI Keynote Slides Need Taste Before Prompts</a>.</p>\n",
    "protected": false,
    "block_version": 1
  },
  "excerpt": {
    "raw": "",
    "rendered": "<p>Kdon over at Discollection is an amazing designer and stylist. I&#39;ve been using her for lots of Static Photography shoots lately and was even more impressed than usual in the job she did styling the Ashley-Rae photoshoot with awesome designer vintage clothes from her store. Part of the AI for Creatives collection. See also: AI [&hellip;]</p>\n",
